Jon '''"bps"''' Cednert is a Swedish ''QuakeWorld'' player with a long and active career under his belt. After having played {{Abbr|RQ|Real Quake/Net Quake/Vanilla Quake}} silently up until [[2001]], he slowly earned reputation as a relentless leader of clan {{player|Suddendeath|flag=se}}, grinding his way to the top in [[2009]]. During these years, the sense for duelling developed through hanging out with players like {{player|LocKtar|flag=se}}, {{player|mawe|flag=se}}, {{player|reppie|flag=nl}} amongst others, eventually refining his duel skills to compete at the highest level.

